{
  "voice_fingerprint": "aa6bbaab77bf3a6e",
  "title": "优秀设计与 DRY",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "title": "好设计就是容易变更"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "title": "ETC 是价值观念"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "title": "拿不准时怎么办"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "title": "程序员一直在维护"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "title": "DRY 管的是知识"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro",
      "title": "片尾"
    }
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01-c01",
      "segment": "s01",
      "description": "一群上师和大神围着缩略词、列表、模式和图表"
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-c02",
      "segment": "s01",
      "description": "提示14 的标题牌亮起，旁边写着 ETC"
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-c03",
      "segment": "s01",
      "description": "解耦、单一职责、命名三个方块依次落下，都指向 ETC"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-c01",
      "segment": "s02",
      "description": "一个写着 ETC 的向导站在几条路线的分岔口"
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-c02",
      "segment": "s02",
      "description": "程序员保存文件、写测试、修复 Bug 时，头顶都冒出同一个问题"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-c01",
      "segment": "s03",
      "description": "分岔口上，几条路看不出哪条更容易变更"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-c02",
      "segment": "s03",
      "description": "一块代码被整块拿出，换上另一块，路上没有路障"
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-c03",
      "segment": "s03",
      "description": "一本工程日志翻开，记着几个选择和猜测，源码里插着一个标签"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-c01",
      "segment": "s04",
      "description": "柯克船长对着电脑说出两条自相矛盾的知识，电脑崩溃"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-c02",
      "segment": "s04",
      "description": "程序员把知识装进文档、规范、代码和测试"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-c03",
      "segment": "s04",
      "description": "一块知识不停改变：客户开会、政府改规定、算法行不通"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-c04",
      "segment": "s04",
      "description": "一条开发过程的时间线，维护从起点一直延续，不是从发布才开始"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-c01",
      "segment": "s05",
      "description": "同一个知识胶囊被复制进规范、流程和程序三处"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-c02",
      "segment": "s05",
      "description": "提示15 的标题牌亮起：DRY"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-c03",
      "segment": "s05",
      "description": "两处表达相同的知识，只改了一处，电脑因为矛盾崩溃"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-c04",
      "segment": "s05",
      "description": "“复制粘贴源码”只占一个大方块的一小角，大方块写着知识和意图"
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-c05",
      "segment": "s05",
      "description": "改一处时，代码、文档、数据库 Schema 要一起改"
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-c01",
      "segment": "outro",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "s01-l01",
      "scene": "s01-c01",
      "text": "谈到软件设计，到处都有上师和大神，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l02",
      "scene": "s01-c01",
      "text": "缩略词、列表、模式、图表应有尽有。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l03",
      "scene": "s01-c01",
      "text": "作者坦言，这本书也未能免俗，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l04",
      "scene": "s01-c01",
      "text": "先给出一句总体概述。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.92
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l05",
      "scene": "s01-c02",
      "text": "好设计比坏设计更容易变更。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.379166666666667
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l06",
      "scene": "s01-c02",
      "text": "好的设计能适应使用它的人，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l07",
      "scene": "s01-c02",
      "text": "落到代码上，就是要能顺应变化。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l08",
      "scene": "s01-c02",
      "text": "这就是 ETC 原则：更容易变更。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.6176666666666666
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l09",
      "scene": "s01-c03",
      "text": "作者认为，无论哪条设计原则，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.094875
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l10",
      "scene": "s01-c03",
      "text": "都是 ETC 的一个特例。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.6641666666666666
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l11",
      "scene": "s01-c03",
      "text": "解耦隔离了关注点，各部分都好改；",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l12",
      "scene": "s01-c03",
      "text": "单一职责让一个需求变化",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l13",
      "scene": "s01-c03",
      "text": "只落在一个模块上；",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l14",
      "scene": "s01-c03",
      "text": "好名字让代码易读，而改代码先要读代码。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "id": "s01-l15",
      "scene": "s01-c03",
      "text": "说到底，都是为了容易变更。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l01",
      "scene": "s02-c01",
      "text": "ETC 是一种价值观念。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.92
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l02",
      "scene": "s02-c01",
      "text": "价值观念帮你做决定：",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l03",
      "scene": "s02-c01",
      "text": "该做这个，还是做那个？",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l04",
      "scene": "s02-c01",
      "text": "在软件领域，ETC 就像一个向导，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l05",
      "scene": "s02-c01",
      "text": "帮你在几条路线中挑出一条。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.0612916666666665
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l06",
      "scene": "s02-c01",
      "text": "最好让它待在意识之下，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.84
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l07",
      "scene": "s02-c01",
      "text": "悄悄把你推向对的方向。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l08",
      "scene": "s02-c02",
      "text": "那要怎么做到呢？",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.12
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l09",
      "scene": "s02-c02",
      "text": "作者的经验是，起初要有意识地强化。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l10",
      "scene": "s02-c02",
      "text": "花一个星期左右，刻意问自己：",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.0152916666666667
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l11",
      "scene": "s02-c02",
      "text": "“我刚做的事，让整个系统",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.24
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l12",
      "scene": "s02-c02",
      "text": "更容易改，还是更难改？”",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l13",
      "scene": "s02-c02",
      "text": "保存文件时问一次，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "s02-l14",
      "scene": "s02-c02",
      "text": "写测试时问一次，修 Bug 时也问一次。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l01",
      "scene": "s03-c01",
      "text": "ETC 有个隐含的前提：",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l02",
      "scene": "s03-c01",
      "text": "我们能分辨哪条路将来更好改。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l03",
      "scene": "s03-c01",
      "text": "多数时候，凭常识就能判断。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l04",
      "scene": "s03-c01",
      "text": "但有时你完全找不到线索。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l05",
      "scene": "s03-c01",
      "text": "作者说这不要紧，可以做两件事。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l06",
      "scene": "s03-c02",
      "text": "第一件：让你写的东西可以替换。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l07",
      "scene": "s03-c02",
      "text": "不管将来怎么变，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.28
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l08",
      "scene": "s03-c02",
      "text": "这段代码都不会挡路。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.52
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l09",
      "scene": "s03-c02",
      "text": "听着有点极端，其实一直都该这样做。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l10",
      "scene": "s03-c02",
      "text": "只要始终保持代码解耦、内聚就行。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l11",
      "scene": "s03-c03",
      "text": "第二件：把它当成培养直觉的机会。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l12",
      "scene": "s03-c03",
      "text": "在工程日志里记下当时的处境：",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l13",
      "scene": "s03-c03",
      "text": "有哪些选择，对变化有什么猜测。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l14",
      "scene": "s03-c03",
      "text": "再在源码里留个标签，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.68
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l15",
      "scene": "s03-c03",
      "text": "以后要改这里时，回头看看当初的记录。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s03-l16",
      "scene": "s03-c03",
      "text": "下次碰到类似的分岔口，就有帮助了。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l01",
      "scene": "s04-c01",
      "text": "柯克船长对付人工智能时，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l02",
      "scene": "s04-c01",
      "text": "最爱给电脑两条互相矛盾的知识。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l03",
      "scene": "s04-c01",
      "text": "可惜，这招拿来搞垮你的代码也一样灵。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l04",
      "scene": "s04-c02",
      "text": "程序员的工作，就是收集、组织、",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l05",
      "scene": "s04-c02",
      "text": "维护和治理知识。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l06",
      "scene": "s04-c02",
      "text": "知识写进文档和规范，在代码里运行，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.36
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l07",
      "scene": "s04-c02",
      "text": "也在测试里决定要检查什么。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l08",
      "scene": "s04-c03",
      "text": "可是知识并不稳定，还常常在变。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l09",
      "scene": "s04-c03",
      "text": "跟客户开次会，对需求的看法就变了；",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l10",
      "scene": "s04-c03",
      "text": "政府改条规定，业务逻辑就过时了；",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.094875
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l11",
      "scene": "s04-c03",
      "text": "测试也可能发现原来的算法行不通。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.72
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l12",
      "scene": "s04-c04",
      "text": "很多人以为，维护从程序发布才开始，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l13",
      "scene": "s04-c04",
      "text": "作者认为他们错了。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l14",
      "scene": "s04-c04",
      "text": "程序员一直处在维护状态，从没停过。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l15",
      "scene": "s04-c04",
      "text": "我们的理解每天都在变，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l16",
      "scene": "s04-c04",
      "text": "新需求不断出现，旧需求也在发展。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.7315416666666668
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l17",
      "scene": "s04-c04",
      "text": "维护不是一个单独的活动，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.84
    },
    {
      "id": "s04-l18",
      "scene": "s04-c04",
      "text": "而是贯穿整个开发过程的常态。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l01",
      "scene": "s05-c01",
      "text": "维护时，得找到并修改知识的表达。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l02",
      "scene": "s05-c01",
      "text": "可在规范、流程和程序里复制知识太容易，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l03",
      "scene": "s05-c01",
      "text": "一旦复制，维护就成了噩梦，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l04",
      "scene": "s05-c01",
      "text": "而且发布之前噩梦就开始了。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l05",
      "scene": "s05-c02",
      "text": "想让软件好开发、好维护，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l06",
      "scene": "s05-c02",
      "text": "唯一办法是遵循 DRY 原则：",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l07",
      "scene": "s05-c02",
      "text": "系统里的每一处知识，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.84
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l08",
      "scene": "s05-c02",
      "text": "都要有单一、明确、权威的表达。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l09",
      "scene": "s05-c02",
      "text": "DRY，就是不要重复自己。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l10",
      "scene": "s05-c03",
      "text": "反过来，把同一件事写在两个以上地方，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.3335833333333333
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l11",
      "scene": "s05-c03",
      "text": "改了一处，就得记着改其他各处。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l12",
      "scene": "s05-c03",
      "text": "不然程序会像那台外星电脑一样，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.4
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l13",
      "scene": "s05-c03",
      "text": "因为一处矛盾而崩溃。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l14",
      "scene": "s05-c03",
      "text": "问题不在记不记得住，而在何时会忘。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.3335833333333333
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l15",
      "scene": "s05-c04",
      "text": "很多人以为 DRY 只是别复制粘贴代码。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l16",
      "scene": "s05-c04",
      "text": "作者说，这只是很小的一部分。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l17",
      "scene": "s05-c04",
      "text": "DRY 针对的是知识和意图的重复：",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l18",
      "scene": "s05-c04",
      "text": "两处说的是同一件事，哪怕写法完全不同。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l19",
      "scene": "s05-c05",
      "text": "可以这样检验：",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.12
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l20",
      "scene": "s05-c05",
      "text": "代码的某一方面要改时，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l21",
      "scene": "s05-c05",
      "text": "你是不是得在好几处、用好几种格式改？",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.0152916666666667
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l22",
      "scene": "s05-c05",
      "text": "比如同时改代码和文档。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "id": "s05-l23",
      "scene": "s05-c05",
      "text": "如果是，你的代码就不满足 DRY。",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-l01",
      "scene": "outro-c01",
      "text": "本期先讲到这里，",
      "audio": "",
      "seconds": 1.28
    },
    {
      "id": "outro-l02",
      "scene": "outro-c01",
      "text": "欢迎大家阅读原著了解更原汁原味的内容，",
